# LeadConnector (GoHighLevel) inbound webhook that both contact forms post to,
# via /api/lead. Server-side only — do not prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_, or it will
# be inlined into the public client bundle.
#
# This URL is an unauthenticated capability: anyone holding it can write leads
# into the CRM. Keep it out of the repo and set it in the Vercel project's
# environment variables at deploy time.
LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=
